Z||000000||Cozmo||07-20-2001||02:52 PM||||OK, I was driving down US19 in St. Pete this AM (If you don't know, that road is one of the most dangerous in the US) and lo and behold...<BR>Up comes a riced out Civic and a euro-ed out GTI weaving and darting thru traffic like a couple of idiots!  Now I'm no prude, in a different situation I would've given them both a dose of my 2M6 Targa exhaust (double kill?)<P>BUT MY GOD!!!<BR>The road was <u>covered</u> with boxes of kittens, girl scout troops and grannys carrying groceries <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>I think we're gonna see a lot more wanna-be car racer movie stars out there in the future... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P><B>C02M0</B>  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cozmosig.jpg"> ||||reg||13
