Z||000002||loafer87gt||07-20-2001||04:34 PM||||Yeah, the whole F & F thing has even hit small town Saskatchewan. When I was home last weekend me and my older bro spotted a bunch of headlights on one of the grid roads on the way to town. We drove out to see what was up and there was a bunch of hicks out there drag racing. I got a good laugh out of the cars racing, 1/2 tons, a Sunfire (the fastest guy there, mid eighties tercel, a 70's Nova, and other assorted crap. I was tempted to take my 190 HP Toyota truck out there and lay some smack down.<p>[This message has been edited by loafer87gt (edited 07-20-2001).]||||reg||1
