Z||000005||Cozmo||07-20-2001||05:22 PM||||Well, I'm not sure where the Targa came from myself <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>The guy I bought it from had no clue about Fieros, it had sat in his yard for 4 years with a blown head gasket. It was in real feral shape when I got it.<BR>It looks like a professional job, has an x-frame underneath and a nice removable fiberglass top. Bad thing is there is no place to store the top in the car (except on the luggage rack, which looks STOOPID).<BR>I've been looking for info on it since I first got the car, still haven't found much...<BR>Here's a couple of pics...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-114F.JPG"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-118F.JPG"> <P><B>C02M0</B><P>||||reg||1
